Modifications in this fork include:
- A-stock (China mainland) data layer using mootdx, Tencent Finance, Eastmoney,
  Sina Finance, Tonghuashun 10jqka, CLS.cn, and Baidu Gushitong (direct HTTP,
  no third-party database dependency)
- Three new A-stock specific analyst agents (Policy, Hot Money, Lockup)
- A-stock trading constraints (T+1, price limits, lot sizes) in Trader and PM
- Chinese language output support
- CSI 300 benchmark for alpha calculation (replacing SPY)
- v0.3.0: Quant pre-filter layer (tradingagents/quant/, 46 strategies, multiprocessing.Pool)
- v0.3.0: LangGraph topology extension (Quant Picker -> 7 Analyst -> ... -> Conflict Resolver)
- v0.3.0: Web UI 4-tab workflow (量化选股 / AI 深度分析 / 综合推荐 / 历史)
- v0.3.0: Conflict Resolver node (rule-based, 🟢强买/🟡关注/🟠冲突/🔴弃 4-tier labels)
- Various prompt and pipeline adaptations for A-share market specifics

See CHANGES_FROM_UPSTREAM.md for the full list of modifications.
